        "callout": "Adding a second field \u2014 instant deeper breakdown"
      },
      "narration": "Here's the part that'll make you grin. Want to break it down further by product? Just drag Product into the Rows area too, right below Store. Now you've got each store, broken down by each product, with totals for every combination. You went from ten thousand rows of chaos to a tidy, readable summary in seconds. And if you want to rearrange it, you just drag those fields around. It's like playing with building blocks except the blocks do your job for you.",
